---
import PersonalBaseLayout from '../layouts/PersonalBaseLayout.astro';

const pageTitle = "Now";
---

<PersonalBaseLayout title={pageTitle}>
	<h1>Personal</h1>
	<p>
		I've started freelancing! Also life is finally slowing down. I'm still pretty busy but
		I finally have the space to breathe. I'm still learning how to balance everything, and
		am really having to get on top of time management but I'm really happy. 
	</p>
	<div class="divider" style="padding-left:4em"></div>
	<h1>Projects and Things I'm Playing With</h1>
	<p>
		You're My Angel - I'm planning a little update for the game as a treat. It'll be out 
		pretty soon but no definite release date yet.
	</p>
	<p>
		Scope Testing Project - I'm really starting to get some story down as well as the base
		systems. I've started to plan for how I'm going to release for testing as well.
	</p>
	<p>
		I've only done art for two attacks so far but given how June and early July were, I'm
		suprised I even got to do those. I think I have one more attack in me but we'll see.
	</p>
	<p>
		Various Tinkerings - I've been looking at old stories as ways to practice writing more as
		well as just keeping the old ideas fresh. Nothing I've committed to enough to give a 
		dedicated entry here but it felt weird not including it here.
	</p>
	<div class="divider" style="padding-left:4em"></div>
	<h1>Media</h1>
	<dl>
		<dt><h2>Games</h2></dt>
		<dd>Rhythm Heaven Groove</dd>
		<dd>Dupery</dd>
		<dd>Heart of the Woods</dd>
		<dt><h2>Most Recent Movie</h2></dt>
		<dd>Spongebob the Musical (rewatch)</dd>
		<dt><h2>Shows</h2></dt>
		<dt>Plus Sized Misadventures In Love!</dt>
		<dt><h2>Books</h2></dt>
		<dd>None right now</dd>	
	</dl>

		<script>
			import '../scripts/menu.js'
		  </script>
</PersonalBaseLayout>

<style>
	main {
		margin: auto;
		padding: 1rem;
		width: 800px;
		max-width: calc(100% - 2rem);
		font-size: 20px;
		line-height: 1.6;
	}
	img {
    float:left;
	padding: 2%;
	}
	.astro-a {
		position: absolute;
		top: -32px;
		left: 50%;
		transform: translatex(-50%);
		width: 220px;
		height: auto;
		z-index: -1;
	}
	h1 {
		font-size: 4rem;
		font-weight: 700;
		line-height: 1;
		text-align: center;
		margin-bottom: 0em;
	}
	.link-card-grid {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(24ch, 1fr));
		gap: 2rem;
		padding: 0;
	}

</style>
